<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vivaantra | Value Investment Program</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1a365d; /* Deep Navy for Trust */
            --accent: #d4af37;  /* Gold for Wealth */
            --text: #333;
            --light: #f4f7f6;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text);
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        header {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p.subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 30px; }

        .btn {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 15px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }

        .section { padding: 60px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: var(--light);
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        th { background: var(--primary); color: white; }

        .cta-footer {
            background: var(--light);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Master the Art of Wealth</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Join the Vivaantra Value Investment Program and learn to find undervalued gems in any market.</p>
            <a href="#join" class="btn">Apply to the Program</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Why Value Investing?</h2>
            <p>At Vivaantra, we don't gamble—we evaluate. Value investing is the strategy of buying high-quality businesses at a discount to their intrinsic value. We provide you with the tools to ignore the noise and focus on fundamental growth.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Program Curriculum</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Module</th>
                        <th>Learning Outcome</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Foundations</strong></td>
                        <td>Mastering Balance Sheets & Cash Flow.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Intrinsic Value</strong></td>
                        <td>Calculating the "Fair Price" using DCF models.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>The Moat</strong></td>
                        <td>Identifying competitive advantages that last.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Risk Management</strong></td>
                        <td>Building a Margin of Safety for your portfolio.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-footer" id="join">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Ready to change your financial future?</h2>
            <p>Slots for the upcoming cohort are limited. Secure your spot today.</p>
            <a href="mailto:info@vivaantra.com" class="btn">Inquire for Enrollment</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
